      "line1": "<span class=\"fontsize-1-5-vw\">“As the industry continues to evolve, Stryker is expanding our capabilities across orthopaedic specialties,” said Katherine Truppi, President of Stryker’s Joint Replacement division. “Surgeons, patients and their caregivers are seeking more solutions, and these innovations are designed to do just that – helping patients get back to the activities they love.”</span>",
