        "jcr:created": "Fri May 29 2026 20:27:31 GMT+0000",
        "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
        "text": "<p>It starts before surgery begins. Using a CT scan of your unique anatomy, Mako's 3D planning software allows your surgeon to build a personalized surgical plan before ever entering the operating room, planning implant size, orientation and alignment based on your individual anatomy.</p>\n",
