        "hideComponent": "false",
        "jcr:created": "Fri May 29 2026 20:27:31 GMT+0000",
        "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
        "text": "<p>The outcomes are meaningful. In some studies, robotic-arm assisted procedures have been associated with improvements in certain early recovery measures, including less pain and shorter recovery times compared to traditional surgery.<sup>3-9</sup></p>\n",
        "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Jun 09 2026 19:33:01 GMT+0000",
